WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.686
Fiona and Carabas were having a picnic.

2
00:00:07.687 --> 00:00:13.069
Puss hunted mice nearby.

3
00:00:13.070 --> 00:00:18.967
Fiona played her guitar.

4
00:00:18.968 --> 00:00:22.841
"That's a beautiful song," Carabas said.

5
00:00:22.842 --> 00:00:31.168
Fiona smiled. "I wrote that song for you."

6
00:00:31.169 --> 00:00:36.059
"Fiona, will you marry me?" Carabas blurted out.

7
00:00:36.060 --> 00:00:43.258
She blushed. "Of course!"

8
00:00:43.259 --> 00:00:46.483
Puss' head popped out of a bush.

9
00:00:46.484 --> 00:00:51.446
"Hooray!" he whispered.

10
00:00:51.447 --> 00:00:53.846
Carabas bit his lip.

11
00:00:53.847 --> 00:00:59.169
"Fiona, I must tell you something."

12
00:00:59.170 --> 00:01:04.398
"Ahh!" Puss dashed over. "Master—"

13
00:01:04.399 --> 00:01:08.670
"No, Puss." Carabas held up a hand.

14
00:01:08.671 --> 00:01:12.144
"I must tell Fiona the truth."

15
00:01:12.145 --> 00:01:17.427
"Fiona, I'm not a duke," Carabas said.

16
00:01:17.428 --> 00:01:21.056
"I'm actually just a poor man.

17
00:01:21.057 --> 00:01:24.731
I understand if you won't marry me now."

18
00:01:24.732 --> 00:01:29.857
Fiona shook her head. "I'm glad you told me.

19
00:01:29.858 --> 00:01:33.423
But I don't care if you're rich or poor.

20
00:01:33.424 --> 00:01:41.814
Carabas, I love you!"

21
00:01:41.815 --> 00:01:45.959
Three weeks later there was a royal wedding.

22
00:01:45.960 --> 00:01:52.569
Carabas and Fiona were married.

23
00:01:52.570 --> 00:01:56.319
Puss wiped away a tear.

24
00:01:56.320 --> 00:02:00.890
"I'm so happy for Master," he thought.

25
00:02:00.891 --> 00:02:02.257
Meow!

26
00:02:02.258 --> 00:02:05.081
Puss turned around.

27
00:02:05.082 --> 00:02:09.722
A cat was looking at him.

28
00:02:09.723 --> 00:02:13.116
Her eyes were big and bright.

29
00:02:13.117 --> 00:02:18.783
Light sparkled on her whiskers.

30
00:02:18.784 --> 00:02:23.238
"Nice boots," she said.

31
00:02:23.239 --> 00:02:29.788
"Um, hello!" Puss said. "I mean, um, thank you!"

32
00:02:29.789 --> 00:02:35.806
The cat smiled. "Would you like to dance?"

33
00:02:35.807 --> 00:02:40.910
"Yes!" Puss bowed.

34
00:02:40.911 --> 00:03:01.678
Together they headed for the dance floor.

